# 统一行尾与文件类型，避免跨平台反复出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音
#
# 规则：
#   - 仓库内文本文件一律以 LF 存储与检出（Linux 服务器 / macOS / WSL 一致）
#   - .bat / .cmd 例外：Windows 批处理需要 CRLF，否则某些 cmd 解析会出错

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
